      "en": "This is the complementary old-age (pension) contribution rate (8.64%) charged to white-collar employees on income group B (the middle income tranche above the basic social security ceiling). It is used as the Band_Rate parameter of the 'Complementary insurance for white collar' SchedCalc in policy tscee_fr. The Contributions theme note ('White Collar Pension') lists an 8.64% rate for income group B, matching this constant."
